@* Fully qualified: _ViewImports pulls in Umbraco's generated models, which have a TrainingClass of
   their own - the content node this record was projected from. *@
@model NDSTK.Booking.Domain.TrainingClass

@* Where the training is, as a link to the map when the club's address is filled in on Inställningar
   and as plain text when it is not. Shared by the class list, Mina bokningar and the reminder
   banner, so all three link the same way and none of them has to know how the URL is built.

   Renders nothing at all when the class has no location, so a caller writing a separator has to
   check that itself - the same arrangement as InstructorName. *@
@if (Model.Location is { Length: > 0 } place)
{
    if (Model.MapUrl is { Length: > 0 } map)
    {
        @* New tab: a member checking where the courts are has not finished with the page they are
           on, and on a phone the search hands over to the map app. *@
        <a class="map-link" href="@map" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
           title="Visa på Google Maps">@place</a>
    }
    else
    {
        @place
    }
}
